cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
type: software
title: "go-nodeset: ClusterShell node sets for Go"
abstract: >-
  A Go library that parses, folds and expands ClusterShell style node sets:
  ranges and steps, several numeric dimensions, set operators, groups
  through a resolver, and host lists that Slurm accepts.
